DEVICE EV3

# Robot Lab: drive at the wall and stop before it.
# Model: EV3 wall stopper (large motors on B and C, ultrasonic sensor on input 4 looking ahead).
# The ultrasonic sensor measures in cm: stop as soon as the wall is closer than 15 cm.
WHEN flag clicked:
  run motor BC at 40 %
  wait until (ev3 distance 4 cm) < 15
  stop motor BC brake
